Subject: Restore original configuration startup and parser behavior

Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Keep the matched original Config constructor, global lifetime, load callbacks,
parser, hash probes and string-capacity behavior outside explicit diagnostics.
Native array elements preserve the original sixteen-byte MWCC array prefix:
GCC/Clang placement arrays with this trivial destructor supply no cookie.
This is compiler/storage adaptation; original source requests remain intact.
Invalid floating-to-integer input and complete file/main/CRT lifetime are not
qualified by this source correction.

